[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558119203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2558119203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2558119203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yec0j","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T13:12:42Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T13:12:42Z","body":"I’m not a fan of this proposal simply because I use both of these functionalities a LOT when I code, and a) having to hold two modifiers when clicking is cumbersome, and b) having to think which of these I need to press.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558119203/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558124925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2558124925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2558124925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YeeN9","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T13:37:21Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T13:37:21Z","body":"> I’m not a fan of this proposal simply because I use both of these functionalities a LOT when I code\r\n\r\nIt's okay, it's just a draft, I'm happy to hear other opinions and find a better solution.\r\n\r\n> a) having to hold two modifiers when clicking is cumbersome\r\n\r\nAnother suggestions:\r\n\r\n* <kbd>Ctrl+LMB</kbd> and <kbd>Alt+LMB</kbd>;\r\n* <kbd>Ctrl+LMB</kbd> and <kbd>Ctrl+RMB</kbd>.\r\n\r\n> b) having to think which of these I need to press\r\n\r\nI'm afraid that in the future you'll have to think about what you want to get. Previously, the same combination is used for opening the built-in help for native symbols and jumping to the source location for custom symbols. But we could also 1. open the documentation for custom symbols (this is especially useful for addons) and 2. search the source location on GitHub for native symbols.\r\n\r\nAs for modifiers, I think maybe we should change the order. Given that there are now tooltips for documentation, perhaps <kbd>Ctrl+LMB</kbd> should be used to jump to the definition, and the alternative combination (whichever we choose) should be used to open the documentation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558124925/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558243257","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2558243257","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2558243257,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ye7G5","user":{"login":"TheRealSlander","id":102065761,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhVmYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102065761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander","html_url":"https://github.com/TheRealSlander","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T21:18:31Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T21:18:31Z","body":"> As for modifiers, I think maybe we should change the order. Given that there are now tooltips for documentation, perhaps Ctrl+LMB should be used to jump to the definition, and the alternative combination (whichever we choose) should be used to open the documentation.\r\n\r\nExactly what I think it would be the best to implement from now on. Tooltips remove the need to jump to the documentation.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558243257/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558430982","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2558430982","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2558430982,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Yfo8G","user":{"login":"AdriaandeJongh","id":5611323,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MTEzMjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5611323?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh","html_url":"https://github.com/AdriaandeJongh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AdriaandeJongh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-22T11:59:29Z","updated_at":"2024-12-22T11:59:29Z","body":"Thanks for sharing your considerations @dalexeev! \r\n\r\nWhat about: \r\n- Ctrl + LMB goes to definition, unless native symbol; then it goes to documentation.\r\n- Alt + LMB goes to documentation.\r\n\r\nNote that when we talk about Ctrl here, that it's actually Cmd here on macOS :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558430982/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565940220","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2565940220","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2565940220,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y8SP8","user":{"login":"BlackShift","id":5866818,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4NjY4MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5866818?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift","html_url":"https://github.com/BlackShift","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BlackShift/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-30T21:37:12Z","updated_at":"2024-12-30T21:37:12Z","body":"I like the change but only when I'm interacting with code that has finished documentation or is more mature.\r\n\r\nMaybe by default ctl-click goes to the code, unless there is a comment like `#mature` at the top.\r\nI also like the alt click or other click behavior.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2565940220/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569380554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2569380554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2569380554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZJaLK","user":{"login":"Yagich","id":24468819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDY4ODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24468819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich","html_url":"https://github.com/Yagich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Yagich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T15:14:20Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T15:14:20Z","body":"> Another suggestions:\r\n> \r\n> * <kbd>Ctrl+LMB</kbd> and <kbd>Alt+LMB</kbd>;\r\n\r\nI'd avoid <kbd>Alt+LMB</kbd> since that's used to add an additional caret","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569380554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572747594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2572747594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2572747594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZWQNK","user":{"login":"TheRealSlander","id":102065761,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhVmYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102065761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander","html_url":"https://github.com/TheRealSlander","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-06T09:48:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-06T09:48:23Z","body":"Just make the shortcuts customizable and we are good to go. Each user would then configure the software to their taste.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2572747594/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2973281718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2973281718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2973281718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xOK22","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T22:10:55Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T22:20:19Z","body":"So recently (in 4.5-dev5) I've found myself often Ctrl+Clicking on the name of a custom class in its own definition (`class_name Base`), or the name of a custom class function where it's defined (`func my_function`), and it felt like a bug that I wouldn't go to the docs for those.\r\n\r\nSeparating the two functionalities can indeed make sense as the current system is a bit awkward where one basically needs to know what the code does to have a feeling for what Ctrl+Click will do.\r\n\r\nBut I wonder if we can make it a bit more clever with the current system:\r\n- Ctrl+Click on native symbol always goes to documentation (current behavior)\r\n- Ctrl+Click on a custom symbol **where it is used** goes to the definition (current behavior)\r\n- Ctrl+Click on a custom symbol **in its definition** goes to the documentation (missing behavior IMO)\r\n\r\nIs that feasible, and would there be any drawbacks I'm not thinking of?\r\n\r\nAn example with comments to clarify the suggestion:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n## Classy.\r\nclass_name Base # Click: Go to `Base` docs.\r\nextends Node # Click: Go to `Node` docs.\r\n\r\n## Best function.\r\nfunc my_function(): # Click: Go to `Base.my_function` docs.\r\n    return\r\n\r\nfunc _ready(): # Click: Go to Node._ready docs.\r\n    my_function() # Click: Go to `Base.my_function` definition.\r\n```\r\n```gdscript\r\n## Drifting.\r\nclass_name Derived # Click: Go to `Derived` docs.\r\nextends Base # Click: Go to `Base` definition.\r\n\r\n## Overriding.\r\nfunc my_function(): # Click: Should it go to `Base.my_function` definition (override) or `Derived.my_function` docs (definition)?\r\n     print(\"Plop\")\r\n\r\nfunc _ready():\r\n    print(self is Base) # Click: Go to `Base` definition.\r\n    my_function() # Click: Go to `Derived.my_function` definition.\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2973281718/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2973286005","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-2973286005","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":2973286005,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xOL51","user":{"login":"TheRealSlander","id":102065761,"node_id":"U_kgDOBhVmYQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102065761?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander","html_url":"https://github.com/TheRealSlander","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheRealSlander/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-14T22:17:56Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T22:17:56Z","body":"> * Ctrl+Click on native symbol always goes to documentation (current behavior)\r\n> * Ctrl+Click on a custom symbol **where it is used** goes to the definition (current behavior)\r\n> * Ctrl+Click on a custom symbol **in its definition** goes to the documentation (missing behavior IMO)\r\n\r\nI supporting this as well. Having this missing behavior would be a nice feature indeed.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2973286005/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5214670335","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100692#issuecomment-5214670335","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100692","id":5214670335,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNtGN_w","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-07T08:34:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-07T08:34:04Z","body":"This PR is outdated and I no longer have the time or desire to continue working on it. You can use this as a basis and credit me as a co-author if you want. There also doesn't seem to be a consensus on the need for symmetry in the behavior between built-in and custom symbols, which is what I've been trying to argue for.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5214670335/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]